# CFEngine 3: CFEngine 3 Reference: language concepts; requirements/languages/cfengine3.md
name     cfengine3 cf3 cfengine
keyword  bundle body agent common edit_line files commands processes packages methods reports vars
keyword  classes meta usebundle promise
builtin  string slist int real data ifvarclass if create perms handle comment any true false
line-comment   #
string   " "  : escapes interp=dollar-braces
string   ' '  : escapes
string   ` `
sigil    @    : attr
operators  =>:;,(){}.!&|
hook     variables
